  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NLM-Nationalization of International Child Development program (ICDP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NLM and our implementing partner Shincon have been asked to continue working to establish ICDP in China. The goal of the project is to see ICDP services provided in all provinces in China, accepted by the government as quality family education.</narrative>
  </description>
